## Overview

Yango Fleet Management System is an enterprise-grade platform designed to streamline vehicle fleet operations, driver management, customer registration, and performance tracking for transportation companies.

The system integrates with the Yango Fleet API to synchronize vehicles, drivers, and car-driver bindings.

### Key Business Processes

- **Customer Registration:** Sales team members register customers by creating car and driver records simultaneously.
- **Vehicle Management:** Track vehicles with status, fuel type, ownership, and Yango synchronization status.
- **Driver Management:** Manage driver profiles including license information, experience, and work rules.
- **Car-Driver Binding:** Associate vehicles with drivers for operational management.
- **Performance Analytics:** Track team and individual performance.
- **Team Management:** Hierarchical management with Team Leaders and Team Members.
- **Yango Integration:** Synchronize vehicles, drivers, and bindings with the Yango platform.

---

## Features

### Admin Dashboard

- Complete employee management (CRUD operations)
- Role-based access control
- Admin, Team Leader, and Team Member roles
- Team structure management
- System-wide performance analytics
- Advanced reporting and data visualization

### Sales Team Features

- Customer registration
- Car and driver registration
- Multi-step registration form with preview
- Work rule selection for drivers
- Real-time vehicle brand and model lookup through NHTSA API
- Registration history and tracking

### Operations Features

- Vehicle management
- Vehicle status tracking
- Driver management
- Driver license validation
- Car-driver binding management
- Yango platform synchronization
- Search and filtering
- Detailed entity views

### Performance Analytics

- Team performance ranking
- Individual member performance tracking
- Pivot views
- Chart views
- Calendar views
- PDF report export
- Date range filtering
- Efficiency scoring
- Trend analysis

### Reporting

- Team Leader performance dashboards
- Member registration counts
- Yango synchronization monitoring
- Downloadable performance reports

---

## Technology Stack

### Backend

| Technology | Purpose |
|---|---|
| Node.js | Backend runtime |
| Express.js | REST API framework |
| PostgreSQL | Relational database |
| JWT | Authentication |
| Axios | API requests |
| bcrypt | Password hashing |
| dotenv | Environment configuration |

### Frontend

| Technology | Purpose |
|---|---|
| React | Frontend framework |
| Vite | Development and build tool |
| React Router | Client-side routing |
| date-fns | Date manipulation |
| html2canvas | HTML-to-image conversion |
| jsPDF | PDF generation |
| Recharts | Data visualization |

### Third-Party APIs

- Yango Fleet API
- NHTSA vPIC API

---

## System Architecture

The system follows a client-server architecture with a clear separation of concerns.

```text
                    +----------------------+
                    |    React Frontend    |
                    |        Vite          |
                    +----------+-----------+
                               |
                               | HTTP / REST API
                               |
                               v
                    +----------------------+
                    |   Express Backend    |
                    |      Node.js         |
                    +-----+-----------+----+
                          |           |
                          |           |
                          v           v
                +-------------+   +-------------+
                | PostgreSQL  |   | Yango Fleet |
                |  Database   |   |     API     |
                +-------------+   +------+------+
                                        |
                                        v
                                +---------------+
                                |  NHTSA vPIC   |
                                |      API      |
                                +--------------